{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261129/photo/bkn-20261129000615728-1129_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261129002541\"/><p>事發在寶田邨一單位。</p><p>昨日(28日)下午4時13分，一名姓朱(59歲)姓朱男子在其寶田邨7座住所突然暈倒，其家人發現慌忙報案。救援人員接報趕至，經檢驗後證實事主已當場死亡，其死因有待驗屍後確定。警員經調查後，案件列「屍體發現」跟進。據了解，朱男有情緒病紀錄。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T16:41:40.660257+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T16:06:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T17:56:08.325801+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T16:35:10.858355+00:00","content_hash":"b1082de3a635daa90992f1c2f72ba2f43585f66f63b6bdb8218bebbe06ec8550","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}